---
// DoorLock: the quarter-turn cylinder on the door's face (Design 01 section 4,
// decision 2.8). The whole door is the activation target, so the lock itself
// is decoration: one click on the door turns the cylinder and opens the door
// (single activation). The close control is the fixed ClosePlate on the stile.
---

<div class="door-lock" aria-hidden="true">
	<span class="door-lock__ring"></span>
	<span class="door-lock__cylinder">
		<span class="door-lock__keyhole"></span>
		<span class="door-lock__mark"></span>
	</span>
	<span class="door-lock__legend">LOCKED</span>
</div>
